                <mxCell id="pBvnCMg8xld050iZZSGV-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;The moderator is responsible for maintaining user activities and managing the content within the system. They can review user accounts, manage account access, and handle product information to ensure that the displayed content remains accurate and appropriate. They can also review reports, feedback, and product reviews to identify and handle inappropriate content. This role focuses on maintaining a safe and well-organized environment for users.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
